    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这一期我们大胆的聊了聊在美国交友的问题。我们请到了两位男生，Sawyer和Theo和我们分享了在西雅图这么一个美国科技移民的聚集地，男生视角下，找女朋友面临的种种问题和趣事。还请到了一位女生，贴心的Maggie来做我们的情感嘉宾。第一次尝试做情感类话题，感觉还是挺不一样的～</span></p><p></p><p><span>本期主播：大黄蜂</span></p><p><span>本期嘉宾：Theo，Sawyer，Maggie</span></p><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="63">00:01:03</a> 开场介绍</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="273">00:04:33</a> 自己为什么找不到女朋友？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="529">00:08:49</a> 奇葩的date经历？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1201">00:20:01</a> 男多女少还是期待太高？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1654">00:27:34</a> 文化和爱好太单一？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2028">00:33:48</a> 怎么吸引女生？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2430">00:40:30</a> 在国内用交友app差别有多大？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2810">00:46:50</a> 能接受一直单身吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3315">00:55:15</a> What is loving anymore?</span></p><p></p><p><span>策划：大黄蜂</span></p><p><span>剪辑：大黄蜂</span></p>]]></description>
